      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This seems unnecessary to me as polygons have no severe impact on game performance. You could have meshes with over 2 million polys and they can be optimised to render at 90 FPS easy since the compute cost is so low nowadays. the biggest performance reducers are IK frames, bones (especially dynamic bones), physics, mesh renderers, textures, materials and shaders.",
