  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Problem: The Problem with Having Avatars with High PolyCount is yes they can Lag those Individuals who can't run the game well due to high PolyCount. So I Think there should be a Safeguard for those who can't run the game well due to Poly's.\n\nSolution: I think there Should Be a Setting for Avatar PolyLimiter that one sets the amount of Poly's that  one wants and if someone is over that limit their Avatar is automatically Hidden to the Ghost Avatar. So that if anyone is Over lets say 70k or 100k whatever the limit is the Avatars Over it will be Hidden.",
